{
 "about": "Fighting poses for the rigged giants. Each pose: bone -> rotation in degrees [x, y, z], applied in XYZ order on top of the bone's rest pose (bone y runs along the bone). Arms and legs hang down at rest: x negative swings them forward, z swings them out to the side (+ for the left limb). For the spine, x positive leans forward and y turns the shoulders. Strikes list keyframes at progress k (0..1); the stance plays between strikes. hips_drop is metres, at the character's own size. Leg bones (listed in flip_xz) have their own x and z axes turned the other way from the arms; the numbers here use the arms' sense (x negative = forward) and the loader negates x and z for those bones.",
